          "raw_rationale": "Two recorded reads by the same actor/session use the same observed operation get_checkauth with no selectors (global_order 3 and 6) and both expose an integer $.user.balance. The only state-changing request recorded between them is the payment POST /transactions (body amount \"13\", global_order 5). The frozen proposal is that a payment decreases the payer's balance, i.e. after lt before; this does not claim monotonic behaviour between the two reads. Setup lists the payment receiver prerequisites eligible for that effect source (open new-transaction page, search user, select user), chosen by business semantics and recorded order.",
